==English==
[[File:Green-Yellow-Red-Pepper-2009.jpg|thumb]]

===Etymology===
From the bell-like shape.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-bell pepper.wav|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|North America|Philippines}} Any of several bell-shaped varieties of {{taxfmt|Capsicum annuum|species}}, an edible, sweet, generally [[mild]] (not [[spicy]]) fruit, originating in the [[New World]].
#: {{hyper|en|pepper<id:any of various Capsicum varieties; their fruit>|capsicum<id:any of various Capsicum varieties; their fruit>}}
#: {{cot|en|q1=hot/spicy|chili#Noun|chili pepper|hot pepper}}
#: {{nearsyn|en|sweet pepper<qq:UK>|capsicum<id:any of various nonspicy Capsicum varieties; their fruit><qq:Australia>}}<!--precisely hypernymous but broadly synonymous-->

